      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "Long before the world was made, the Word was there with God. In fact, the Word was God. Every single thing that has ever been made came into being because of him; without him, not one thing exists.",
          "ko": "세상이 생기기 훨씬 전부터, 말씀은 하나님과 함께 계셨습니다. 사실 말씀은 곧 하나님이셨습니다. 지금까지 만들어진 모든 것은 그분을 통해 생겨났고, 그분이 없이는 아무것도 존재하지 않습니다."
        },
        {
          "text": "A light began to shine right in the middle of the darkness, and no matter how hard the darkness tried, it could never put that light out. The Word entered the world he had made among his own people, yet they turned him away.",
